<lb n="21"/>mals zue antwuert nachpeurlich nit verhalten,
<lb n="22"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seyen</unclear> euch alle guete <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpeurschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerzei</unclear>-
